.TH VEC2 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
Vec2 \- A 2D vector of floats: positions, velocities, directions, sizes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct { float x, y; } Vec2;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A 2D vector of floats: positions, velocities, directions, sizes. The engine's currency for anything with an x and a y in world or screen space. Pointer\-free and tiny, so it lives directly inside entities in GameState. All v2_* helpers take and return Vec2 by value. Same layout as Point.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B x
horizontal component
.TP
.B y
vertical component (positive is down on screen)
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR v2 (3),
.BR v2_add (3),
.BR v2_scale (3),
.BR v2_norm (3),
.BR gge\-math (7),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
